      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on a philosophy essay about individual liberty vs collective responsibility, specifically how that plays out in tax policy. can u give me a breakdown of the main moral frameworks used by libertarians and social democrats? i need to make sure i'm presenting the strongest version of each argument for my paper. thanks!",
